==English==

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|psychology|-ical}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˌsaɪkəˈlɒdʒɪkl/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˌsaɪkəˈlɑːdʒɪkl/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of or pertaining to [[psychology]].
#: {{ux|en|I'm concerned about their '''psychological''' well-being.}}
#: {{ux|en|The film was a dark '''psychological''' thriller.}}
# Without an [[objective]], or reasonably logical foundation.
#: {{ux|en|Prices seem to have stopped rising, having hit the '''psychological''' ceiling of just under 100 dollars.}}

